<p>Prints a float to the log file.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Void%20keyword" title="Void keyword">void</a> PrintFloat(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Float%20keyword" title="Float keyword">float</a> fFloat,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nWidth&#160;= 18,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nDecimals&#160;= 9,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> bPrepend&#160;= FALSE<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">fFloat<dd>The float value to print out to the log<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nWidth<dd>The size of the value before the decimal. Must be a value between 0 and 18 inclusive<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nDecimals<dd>The number of decimal places. Must be a value between 0 and 9 inclusive<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bPrepend<dd>Specifies if the type of value should be prepended on to the log string
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Nothing.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
</p>
</dl>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Prints the float fFloat to the log file based on the nWidth and nDecimal specifications.
If bPrepend is TRUE, then 'PRINTFLOAT' will be prepended onto the text outputted to the
log file.
</p><p><br />
</p>
